Additional dependencies
-----------------------

Other Rust dependencies and their declared SPDX license expressions are
recorded in talos-rs/Cargo.lock and the package manifests in the Talos source
release. Each dependency retains its own license and notices in its source
package. In particular, packages with a choice of licenses may be used under
any license offered by that package; this notice does not relicense them.

The dependency versions above were present in the Cargo.lock used to prepare
this release. Consult that lockfile for the complete resolved dependency set.
